From 80a38f3c0ff7b4f66062542b48fef99ceb631508 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Brue <ryanbrue.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 01:11:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: smb347: treat a missing monitored-battery as
 no battery info

smb347_get_battery_info() lets the probe continue when
power_supply_get_battery_info() finds no battery, but it only accepts
-ENXIO and -ENODEV for that. Since commit 570ba047a654 ("power: supply:
core: battery-info: fully switch to fwnode"), the core looks the
"monitored-battery" reference up with fwnode_find_reference(), which
returns -ENOENT when the property is absent, where it used to return
-ENODEV. The core itself already accepts both codes elsewhere.

So on boards that don't describe a battery, such as the Samsung Galaxy
Tab 2 10.1 (omap4-samsung-espresso10), the probe now fails:

  smb347 4-0006: probe with driver smb347 failed with error -2

and the charger is never registered. Accept -ENOENT as well, so the chip
is set up from the platform properties and keeps its OTP defaults for
the battery-specific limits.

Fixes: 570ba047a654 ("power: supply: core: battery-info: fully switch to fwnode")
Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/power/supply/smb347-charger.c | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/smb347-charger.c b/drivers/power/supply/smb347-charger.c
index c1b67dac8ef6..298b0bcd63bc 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/smb347-charger.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/smb347-charger.c
@@ -1291,7 +1291,13 @@ static int smb347_get_battery_info(struct smb347_charger *smb)
 		supply = smb->usb;
 
 	err = power_supply_get_battery_info(supply, &info);
-	if (err == -ENXIO || err == -ENODEV)
+	/*
+	 * No monitored-battery in the firmware node is not an error: fall back
+	 * to the chip's OTP defaults. power_supply_get_battery_info() reports
+	 * that as -ENOENT since it looks the phandle up with
+	 * fwnode_find_reference().
+	 */
+	if (err == -ENXIO || err == -ENODEV || err == -ENOENT)
 		return 0;
 	if (err)
 		return err;
-- 
2.55.0

